silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_25_six_step_bridge_deep_dives_sections_01_mereology_six_step_concrete_anchor_0 silm:hasExample "In 'S01MereologySixStepConcreteAnchor0', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, Mittens (microchip 985112345678901) as the mereological whole: assembled from HeadRegion (vet MRI scan region 1), TorsoRegion (vet MRI scan region 2), and LimbRegion (vet MRI scan region 3) via compatible cocone legs. The part-identification at the shared head-torso boundary is the relator in R_P.." .
